# Ownership for codeowners-tool itself. Without this file the repo fails the
# tool's own A-11 check ("the CODEOWNERS file itself has no owner").
#
# One rule, deliberately: a single maintainer means narrower rules would name the
# same owner, and each would risk an A-4 (matches no file) or A-6 (fully shadowed)
# finding. `*` covers every path including this one. Verify with `codeowners-tool
# audit`; add narrower rules when there is a second owner to name.
